\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces The generalisation gap. Grey bars: within-distribution scene success rate (seed mean). Blue bars: held-out scene success rate with 95\,\% confidence intervals. The single-agent models show no gap, because their training goal distribution coincides with the held-out suite; the self-play models collapse from their within-distribution rate to the held-out rate.}}{44}{}\protected@file@percent }
